    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c44935169046c38e92340fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我点头表示肯定。\n因为在这三场胜负中，\n我也感受到了和葛城王牌一样的不甘心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a122e9ddc98a8684c9d795472107f016e5c20dd451e2a31a2f4ecdc20522b47f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dd86d86da0845c039fe259",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明的粉丝A",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beef4fcaa6ce017770188cdc55f77f05501da94429f77c346e34f37b415e1d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:defc65c367b2e9732d1f132e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦咦～～～～！？千明输了！？\n骗人的吧──！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b34e54c9e461115f7ce4319586da6ec72c77916de01a39450b0e14ff8a70557",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b457ad853cbbd41f29fc4cfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌绝不是千明代表的附属品，\n而是她的竞争对手。\n也是走在时代最前线的赛马娘之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7af9837650091c50efcb54214d81e65b328547cbee3090d72c4d9293321cd3ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ef992deb8a7b210783d1a6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把中距离练到极致吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "5da3b29c934470836af9bc6026c85f379d291f3e88204225817514d16bbcf315",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37ae347cfc16634fcfda0ad4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然人们并不如此看待葛城王牌，\n那现在该做的就是提升她的存在感，\n不顾意愿强行闯入人们的视线里──",
      "source_fingerprint": "11a0cfb4841155d494c73176b7836a6d3ea4ce11d442be75bced37410510040d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd892868d825f9736b3b809f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──以至今为止的比赛来看，\n我确定了葛城王牌在中距离特别优秀。\n接下来应该专注加强这个强项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57d3de33600f87fba133440220fb43dab36dc2b4d48df8e3b13be8c249764f84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f28bb6ad24972dabd48933",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "简单来说，我们的目标就是成为\n这时代的“中距离最强”。也就是说，\n需要取得符合这个头衔的成就……！",
